  "description": "I’ve been reborn as Leonora, the illegitimate child of the dukedom of Hachaina. Though death will soon befall our ill-fated house, this storybook life is better than the betrayal I suffered in my past life. But what if I could change destiny? I’ll tame wild beasts, harness the power of auror, and do whatever it takes to save my family. Also, I’m not alone. Someone has reincarnated into this story to sabotage me. Will I have enough time to change my fate? Or will the House of Hachania fall again? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
